<title>UK: Merrill Lynch leads 5-tranche asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch leads 5-tranche asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch has lead-managed the following five-tranche bond for Green Tree Financial Corp.</p>
<p>ISSUE TYPE RECREATIONAL, EQUIPMENT &amp; CONSUMER TRUST 1996-D</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A1 HE</p>
<p> AMT    $30,820,569   SPREAD     +85 BP    LEG MAT	 .DEC.22</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE 99.96875  AVE LIFE     4.12 YRS</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER   99.96875</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 5.5 PCT DEC 2000</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A1</p>
<p> AMT    $280,779,431  COUPON 1MTHL +20 BP  LEG MAT	 .DEC.22</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 AVE LIFE     2.26 YRS</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A2</p>
<p> AMT    $15,200,000   COUPON 1MTHL +32 BP  LEG MAT	.DEC.22</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE PAR	 AVE LIFE     2.26 YRS</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER   PAR</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A3</p>
<p> AMT    $15,200,000   COUPON 1MTHL +41 BP  LEG MAT	 .DEC.22</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 AVE LIFE     2.26 YRS</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A4</p>
<p> AMT    $12,350,000   COUPON 1MTHL +56 BP  LEG MAT	 .DEC.22</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 AVE LIFE     2.26 YRS</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> PAY DATE   27.DEC.96 LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) ONE</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS GLOBAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
